[{:adr/authoritative_for ["kami-genesis->com-nvidia-isaac-sim、kami-shugyo->com-nvidia-isaac-lab のrename決定と根拠" "FMI/ISO 8373/ISO 10218がこの2件に適用されない理由" "com-nvidia-isaac（既存の小さいschema-CRUD actor）とcom-nvidia-isaac-sim/-labの区別"], :adr/supersedes [], :adr/com-nvidia-isaac-distinction "kotoba-lang/com-nvidia-isaac already exists but is a small schema-CRUD actor (Datom-log CRUD+validation, OpenAPI-derived) migrated from etzhayyim/root/20-actors/nvidia_isaac-compat -- ADR-2607041500 itself describes kami-nv-compat (and by extension kami-genesis/kami-shugyo) as 'distinct, larger' from this pilot-batch entry. Not a collision: -sim/-lab suffixes (matching NVIDIA's real Isaac Sim / Isaac Lab product split) disambiguate by scope.", :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "kotoba-lang-cad-cam-integration", :adr/related [], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607087500-kami-genesis-shugyo-nvidia-isaac-rename", :adr/why-com-nvidia-vendor-compat "{:basis \"ADR-2607041500 (etzhayyim *-compat catalog migration, 1,027 repos, com-nvidia-isaac/-cosmos/-drive/-nvml pilot batch) established the com-<vendor>-* convention for clean-room facades of vendor-specific proprietary APIs\", :verification \"WebSearch against docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com and isaac-sim.github.io/IsaacLab confirmed isaacsim.core.api (World, Articulation, PhysX 5 GPU dynamics) and isaaclab.envs.ManagerBasedRLEnv are real, documented, current NVIDIA product APIs -- not assumed from the repos' own README claims alone\"}", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/dependent-updates "{:repos-checked \"grepped orgs/*/*/deps.edn for kami-genesis/kami-shugyo references\", :false-positive \"orgs/etzhayyim/root/deps.edn matched but is an ADR-registry EDN data file, not a tools.deps dependency declaration\", :result \"zero real dependents; no consumer deps.edn updates needed\"}", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-09", :adr/renames "[{:old \"kotoba-lang/kami-genesis\", :new \"kotoba-lang/com-nvidia-isaac-sim\", :reason \"clean-room isaacsim.core.api (World/Articulation) + PhysX 5 (spatial rigid-body dynamics, GJK/EPA contact) API-surface facade -- verified against NVIDIA's own docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com, not renamed on assumption\", :merge-commits [\"6387b37e926ebc94a4c2740260423c9d46a3dbf5\" \"30475b5e4bc429166cf7ec70533f09657e74640e\"], :tests \"110 tests / 2463 assertions, unchanged (genesis.* namespaces untouched)\"} {:old \"kotoba-lang/kami-shugyo\", :new \"kotoba-lang/com-nvidia-isaac-lab\", :reason \"isaaclab.envs.ManagerBasedRLEnv (manager-based MDP RL environment) compat target -- verified against isaac-sim.github.io/IsaacLab docs\", :merge-commits [\"7ed63bd4b19a0ab215ef12765a8e82871e670194\" \"6801f9d25986b22b70f175d348197c33f6503ce4\"], :tests \"46 tests / 867 assertions, unchanged (shugyo.* namespaces untouched)\"}]", :adr/deciders ["Jun Kawasaki"], :adr/date "2026-07-09", :adr/manifest-update "{:path-overrides [\"orgs/kotoba-lang/kami-genesis -> orgs/kotoba-lang/com-nvidia-isaac-sim\" \"orgs/kotoba-lang/kami-shugyo -> orgs/kotoba-lang/com-nvidia-isaac-lab\"], :method \"GitHub API single-entry commits (blob-SHA optimistic lock) for repos.edn; nbb scripts/gen-west-manifest.cljs --entry for west.yml new-entry generation (server-side pin-verified) + manual removal of the 2 old entries (--entry only adds), pushed via the same API pattern -- 10 insertions/10 deletions, minimal diff\"}", :db/id -1, :adr/why-not-fmi-8373-10218 "{:fmi \"Functional Mock-up Interface (co-simulation format) -- neither repo implements .fmu import/export or modelDescription.xml parsing; FMI IS a real implementable interface, but this is new scope, not something already done, so it cannot be a rename basis (same implement-before-rename principle as ADR-2607084200's brep/STEP)\", :iso-8373 \"pure robotics vocabulary/terminology standard -- nothing to implement in software\", :iso-10218 \"industrial robot safety design requirements -- a certification/compliance standard for hardware risk assessment, not a software API\"}", :adr/correction-note "Initial ADR number 2607086600 (referenced in both repos' README rename notices and the repos.edn comment before this ADR file itself was written) collided with a concurrent session's cloud-itonami-commrepair-9512-coverage ADR. Caught via GitHub API listing before writing this file; corrected to 2607087500 via 3 follow-up single-line fixes (2 README commits + 1 repos.edn API edit), plus a west.yml pin re-advance for the 2 repos' new HEAD after the README fix commits.", :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "kotoba-lang/kami-genesis を com-nvidia-isaac-sim へ、kotoba-lang/kami-shugyo を com-nvidia-isaac-lab へrename -- FMI/ISO 8373/ISO 10218ではなくNVIDIA vendor-API-compat基準を適用"}]